                    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch text-xl animate-spin-slow"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-100 to-sky-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent flex items-center gap-2">
                        莫爾圓與微小應力元素互動分析儀
